$common=@'
Create a genuinely art-directed, gorgeous contemporary exercise execution UI, not a recolored dashboard. Attached screenshot is ONLY functional inventory and exercise video reference. Completely reinvent spatial composition, shape language and data presentation according to ART DIRECTION below. Flat straight-on app screenshot, 1536x864 landscape, no device, no perspective, no collage, no design notes printed. Cohesive excellent visual craft, readable native Russian typography and large touchscreen targets. Visually dynamic but safe, organized and usable. Do NOT imitate the original screenshot layout. No crude saturated neon backgrounds, no generic nested dark cards everywhere, no arbitrary clip-art lightning. Preserve these functions visibly, no hidden controls:
System status strip AI · ВЫКЛ, МОТОРЫ — % / — кг, Нет связи and red Аварийная остановка consistently upper right. Title Жим с пола со штангой; Упражнение 1 из 5; Базовый режим; Упражнения 0/5 navigation; Подход 1 из 4 · Разминка; 21 кг badge.
One exercise video showing clothed adult doing barbell floor press on floor, full body visible, no bench, no playback toolbar. Main repetition counter 9 (only ONE large repetition counter), target 10–12 повторов, TWO explicit minus and plus touch buttons and progress indicator. Separate weight stepper Вес, кг with minus / 21 / plus.
Four set entries, all present: Р · СЕЙЧАС · 10–12 × 21 кг; 1 · РАБОЧИЙ · 8–12 × 42,5 кг; 2 · РАБОЧИЙ · 8–12 × 42,5 кг; 3 · РАБОЧИЙ · 8–12 × 42,5 кг. Three metrics АМПЛИТУДА 92%, ТЕМП хорошо, ПОЛОЖЕНИЕ ГРИФА 86 см.
One bar motion instrument ПОЛОЖЕНИЕ · ММ, lower НИЗ 640, current ГРИФ 980, upper ВЕРХ 1320; preserve relative order and marker within bounds. Extra sensor statuses Ампл. —% and Синхр. — мм. Do not confuse unknown sensor dash values with sample metric tile values. Do not add invented telemetry.
Visible actions Пропустить упражнение and Завершить подход; note Лёгкий разминочный подход. Do not add pause or absent calibration settings, do not delete controls, no tiny text or clipping. Layout must be recognizably novel, polished, high-end, not merely different colors. Motion concept is guidance for visual design only; output a single static UI frame with no explanatory text.
'@
